	"_description": "Keyboards beyond the row-staggered ISO and ANSI boards (physical_keys.json): ortholinear, split and column-staggered ergonomic boards with thumb clusters. For each: the centre of each key in key units (19.05 mm) and its logical row (rank in its column, the home row being 3, thumb keys 5), the default finger of each key and each finger's home key. Imported on 2026-11-14 from QMK's layout file (key positions) and default keymap (which key code each position types); « placed » lists the modifiers the default keymap lacks and where they were put, and the thumb keys of the model (thumb_keys of analysis_model.json: NonConvert for the left thumb, Convert and KanaMode for the right) on free thumb keys beside the space bar and AltGr, added on 2026-11-19 for the layouts that put a letter on a thumb key. A key code the board lacks is reported per layout by the engine. Decided by the agent, to review by the maintainer.",
